on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [  3] pushint8 255 ............................ <255>
  [  6] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  9] set 4 ................................... set the volume of sound 2 to 255
  [ 11] pushint8 9 .............................. <9>
  [ 14] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <9>
  [ 16] extcall 119 ............................. puppetTransition(9)
  [ 19] pushcons 0 .............................. <"rim">
  [ 21] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <"rim">
  [ 23] extcall 37 .............................. puppetSound("rim")
  [ 26] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 29] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <2>
  [ 31] extcall 22 .............................. go(2)
  [ 33] ret
end
